  "desc": "Use Data knobs to build data products. Build AI Assitant to empower humans, Build AI Twins to super charge physical objects and factories. Data knobs let build chocolotae bars of data. It let you build higher level concepts that humans and bots can consume. AI twins become more intelligent using data products. Data knobs capabilities build data products with governance and lineage. Dataknobs products are Kreate and ABExperiment. With Kreate you create data product, visualization and chatbots. With AB Experiment you experiment what works. Levers/knobs give you control to use data in effective manner. Knobs are those input that have highest influence on outcomes. Levers also provide blind spot in data where you should be testing",
