  "main_content": "class=\"text-gray-800 antialiased\">\n<!-- Navigation Header -->\n\n<main>\n<!-- Hero Banner Section -->\n<section class=\"bg-indigo-700 text-white py-20 sm:py-32\">\n<div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\">\n<h1 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-4 leading-tight\">\n                    Use <span class=\"text-indigo-300\">Data Knobs</span> to build Data Products\n                </h1>\n<h2 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl text-indigo-200 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                    Build higher level concepts from raw data—creating packaged, delightful, and ready-to-consume \"Chocolate Bars of Data.\"\n                </h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-6\">\n<a class=\"button-big bg-white text-indigo-700 hover:bg-gray-100 font-bold py-3 px-10 rounded-full shadow-2xl text-lg inline-block\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/data-products/guide.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n                        Create Useful Data-As-Product\n                    </a>\n<a class=\"button-big text-white border-2 border-indigo-400 hover:bg-indigo-600 font-bold py-3 px-10 rounded-full shadow-2xl text-lg inline-block\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/data-products/make-data-products-usable.html\">\n                        Make Data Product Usable\n                    </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Dataknobs Philosophy Section -->\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-white\" id=\"philosophy\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\">\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Why - Dataknobs Philosophy</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 mb-12\">\n                    Create levers to control and **build <a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/data-products/\">data products</a>** for multiple use cases\n                </p>\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10\">\n<!-- CIO -->\n<div class=\"p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-t-4 border-blue-500\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/cio-dataknobs-partnership.html\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">CIO</h3>\n<p class=\"text-indigo-600 font-medium mb-4\">Define how data is being applied</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">\n                            Knobs provide the interpretation layer, giving you control over how information is applied in various AI and experimentation processes.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n</div>\n<!-- CDO -->\n<div class=\"p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-t-4 border-green-500\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/cdo-dataknobs-partnership.html\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">CDO</h3>\n<p class=\"text-green-600 font-medium mb-4\">Improve performance of data org</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">\n                            Manage the complexity of modern enterprise data through standardized Knobs that ensure governance, lineage, and compliance across the organization.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n</div>\n<!-- CPO -->\n<div class=\"p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg border-t-4 border-red-500\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/cpo-dataknobs-partnership.html\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">CPO</h3>\n<p class=\"text-red-600 font-medium mb-4\">Build data products for multiple use cases</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600\">\n                            Leverage Kreate to rapidly generate data products, websites, and bots, ensuring market validation through controlled experimentation with Knobs.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Capabilities Carousel Section -->\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-100\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-center text-gray-900 mb-2\">BUILD DATA PRODUCTS USING GENAI</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">\n                    DATA PRODUCTS BUILD RIGHT FROM START\n                </p>\n<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n<div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white\" id=\"carousel-container\">\n<!-- Image Slides -->\n<div class=\"mySlides fade\" style=\"display: block;\">\n<img alt=\"Co Pilot for Data Product\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-video rounded-lg\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/5101_gdrive/site1.kreatewebsites.com/input/content/data-products/co-pilot-for-data-products/images/Slide1200/Slide1.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mySlides fade\">\n<img alt=\"Dataknobs Capabilities\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-video rounded-lg\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/5106_gdrive/www.dataknobs.com/input/content/customer-slides/dataknobs-capabilities-enterprise/images/Slide1200/Slide4.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mySlides fade\">\n<img alt=\"Kreate Kontrols and Knobs\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-video rounded-lg\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/5106_gdrive/www.dataknobs.com/input/content/slides/dataknobs/images/Slide1200/dataknobs-1.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Dots for indication and manual control -->\n<div class=\"text-center pt-4\">\n<span class=\"dot inline-block h-3 w-3 mx-1 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-indigo-700\" onclick=\"currentSlide(1)\"></span>\n<span class=\"dot inline-block h-3 w-3 mx-1 bg-gray-400 rounded-full cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-indigo-700\" onclick=\"currentSlide(2)\"></span>\n<span class=\"dot inline-block h-3 w-3 mx-1 bg-gray-400 rounded-full cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-indigo-700\" onclick=\"currentSlide(3)\"></span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"text-center text-lg text-gray-700 mt-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">\n                        Dataknobs capabilities—**KREATE, KONTROLS, and KNOBS**—ensure creative generation, robust guardrails, and precise experimentation for all your data and AI assets.\n                    </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Core Capabilities (Kreate, Kontrols, Knobs) Breakdown -->\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-white\" id=\"capabilities\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-center text-gray-900 mb-2\">What - Dataknobs Capabilities</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">\n                    Built with intention, guardrails, and levers\n                </p>\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n<!-- KREATE -->\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-indigo-500\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/kreate/\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">KREATE</h3>\n<p class=\"text-indigo-600 font-medium mb-4\">Create What Matters</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">\n                            AI-powered creation of new data with complete lineage, web designs, websites, and AI Assistants. Build things beyond imagination at fast speed.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-semibold hover:text-indigo-800 transition duration-150\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/kreate/\">\n                            Explore Kreate →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n<!-- KONTROLS -->\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-green-500\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/kontrols/\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">KONTROLS</h3>\n<p class=\"text-green-600 font-medium mb-4\">Focus on guardrails and risks</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">\n                            Provide essential guardrails, lineage, audit trails, and governance for GenAI and Data Products. Apply creativity with responsibility.\n                        </p></a>\n<a class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold hover:text-green-800 transition duration-150\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/kontrols/\">\n                            Explore Kontrols →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n<!-- KNOBS -->\n<div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md border-l-4 border-orange-500\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/knobs/\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">KNOBS</h3>\n<p class=\"text-orange-600 font-medium mb-4\">Enable diagnostic and experimentation</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">\n                            Identify tunable parameters (levers) that have the highest influence on outcomes. Essential for faster A/B testing and diagnostics of AI agents.\n                        </p></a>\n<a class=\"text-orange-600 font-semibold hover:text-orange-800 transition duration-150\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/knobs/\">\n                            Explore Knobs →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<blockquote class=\"mt-16 text-center text-lg italic text-gray-500 border-t pt-8\">\n                    \"Data products generally require validation both of <strong>whether the algorithm works</strong>, and of <strong>whether users like it</strong>.\"\n                    \n</blockquote>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Solution Focus (Predictive AI, GenAI, Engineering) -->\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-center text-gray-900 mb-2\">How - Dataknobs Deliver</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">\n                    Using the Drivetrain approach to build AI-driven data products effectively.\n                </p>\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n<!-- Predictive AI -->\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition duration-300\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/ai/predictive-tabular-ml.html\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Predictive AI</h3>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Use AI for predicting specific outcomes</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                            Traditional ML methods for specific outcomes like **Predictive Maintenance**, Risk Modeling, Sales Forecasting, and Anomaly Detection where historical patterns are strong.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-indigo-600 font-semibold hover:text-indigo-800\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/ai-twin/\">\n                            AI for Asset Mgmt →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n<!-- Generative AI -->\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition duration-300\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/generativeai/generative-ai-101-slides.html\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Generative AI</h3>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">Use GenAI for generation and understanding like human</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                            For creating new content (text, images) or human-like context understanding in unstructured environments, such as **Stocks Earnings Call Analysis**.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-indigo-600 font-semibold hover:text-indigo-800\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/generativeai/generative-ai-101-slides.html\">\n                            Generative AI Tutorial and Use Cases →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n<!-- Engineering -->\n<div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition duration-300\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/agent-ai/tutorials.html\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">AI Agents</h3>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4\">AI Agents built to think, act, and deliver intelligent apps</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700\">\n                            With Dataknobs Agentic AI, data becomes an active operator in your organization. Dataknobs delivers AI agents that think, act, and adapt across your business\n                        </p>\n</a><a class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-indigo-600 font-semibold hover:text-indigo-800\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/agent-ai/tutorials.html\">\n                            AI Agents →\n    