s=\"bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/kreate/kreatebots/\">\n<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">Create Bots</h3>\n<p class=\"text-indigo-600 font-medium mb-4\">AI Agent, AI Assistants and chatbots</p>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">\n                            Create chatbots and AI agents with ease. Focus on enriching your knowledge base and use pre-built templates, including RAG implementation.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"text-indigo-600 font-semibold hover:text-indigo-800 transition duration-150\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/products/kreatebots/\">\n                            KREATE BOTS →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Use Cases Section (Simplified) -->\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-100\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-center text-gray-900 mb-2\">Use Cases Built With Dataknobs</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">\n                    Turning Raw Data Into Intelligent, End-to-End Data Products\n                </p>\n<div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-center\">\n<div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-4\">\n<img alt=\"Dataknobs Use Cases for Every Industry\" class=\"rounded-xl shadow-xl w-full h-auto object-cover border-4 border-white\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/5108_gdrive/slides.kreatewebsites.com/input/content/dataknobs/customers-slides/dataknobs-use-cases/dataknobs-use-cases/images/Slide1000/dataknobs-use-cases-1.png\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-4\">\n<a href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/use-cases/\">\n<h3 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4\">For Every Industry</h3>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-6\">\n                            DataKnobs builds AI-powered data products that convert raw data into intelligent, end-to-end solutions tailored for business impact. Our portfolio includes specialized assistants for:\n                        </p>\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside\">\n<li>Business Analyst assistant for e-commerce analytics</li>\n<li>Tax Research Assistant and Financial Planner Assistant</li>\n<li>Earnings Call Insight Generator</li>\n<li>Predictive Maintenance for manufacturing (AI Twin)</li>\n<li>Compliance Assistant (Komply)</li>\n</ul>\n</a>\n<a class=\"mt-6 inline-block bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-6 rounded-full hover:bg-indigo-700 transition duration-300\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/use-cases/\">\n                            View All Use Cases →\n                        </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Blog/Article Snippets (Simplified) -->\n<section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n<h2 class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-center text-gray-900 mb-2\">Latest Insights from the Blog</h2>\n<p class=\"text-xl text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">\n                    Deep dives into GenAI, Data Products, and Experimentation.\n                </p>\n<div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n<!-- Article 1 -->\n<a class=\"block p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/data-products/\" target=\"_blank\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1\">Build Dataproducts</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2 hover:text-indigo-800\">How Dataknobs help in building data products</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            Enterprises are most successful when they treat data like a product, designing it for multiple use cases and consumption.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<!-- Article 2 -->\n<a class=\"block p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/generativeai/generative-ai-101-slides.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1\">CTO and CIO Guide</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2 hover:text-indigo-800\">How to Budget for GenAI (Slides &amp; Guide)</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            Planning for GenAI adoption requires a careful balance of infrastructure, compliance, data, licensing, and scaling costs.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<!-- Article 3 -->\n<a class=\"block p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/agent-ai/\" target=\"_blank\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1\">AI Agent Tutorial</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2 hover:text-indigo-800\">How we use AI Agent for various scenarios</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            Learn about Agent AI features, types, benefits, challenges, and effective design patterns for modern systems.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n<!-- Article 4 -->\n<a class=\"block p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\" href=\"https://www.dataknobs.com/orthogonal.html\" target=\"_blank\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1\">Why knobs matter</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2 hover:text-indigo-800\">Knobs are levers using which you manage output</h4>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                            See the Drivetrain approach for building AI products, where knobs are the abstract, controllable inputs key to success.\n                        </p>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Tailwind YouTube embed (responsive) -->\n<section class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10\">\n<div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg ring-1 ring-black/10\">\n<div class=\"relative w-full pb-[56.25%]\"> <!-- 16:9 -->\n<iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\" frameborder=\"0\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5GHTIrQQAL4\" title=\"YouTube video player\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<!-- Footer Wrapper -->\n\n<!-- Slideshow JavaScript Logic (Re-implemented for the new structure) -->\n<script>\n        let slideIndex = 0;\n        const slideInterval = 5000; // Change image every 5 seconds\n\n        function showSlides() {\n            let i;\n            let slides = document.getElementsByClassName(\"mySlides\");\n            let dots = document.getElementsByClassName(\"dot\");\n\n            if (slides.length === 0) return;\n\n            // Hide all slides\n            for (i = 0; i < slides.length; i++) {\n                slides[i].style.display = \"none\";\n            }\n            \n            // Increment index, looping back to 0\n            slideIndex++;\n            if (slideIndex > slides.length) { slideIndex = 1 }\n\n            // De-activate all dots\n            for (i = 0; i < dots.length; i++) {\n                dots[i].classList.remove(\"bg-indigo-500\");\n                dots[i].classList.add(\"bg-gray-400\");\n            }\n\n            // Show the current slide and activate the current dot\n            slides[slideIndex - 1].style.display = \"block\";\n            dots[slideIndex - 1].classList.remove(\"bg-gray-400\");\n            dots[slideIndex - 1].classList.add(\"bg-indigo-500\");\n\n            // Restart the auto-play loop\n            setTimeout(showSlides, slideInterval); \n        }\n\n        // Thumbnail image controls (for manual clicks on dots)\n        function currentSlide(n) {\n            slideIndex = n - 1; // n is 1-based, slideIndex is used 0-based in the function above\n            \n            // Manually trigger the transition immediately when a dot is clicked\n            let slides = document.getElementsByClassName(\"mySlides\");\n            let dots = document.getElementsByClassName(\"dot\");\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < slides.length; i++) {\n                slides[i].style.display = \"none\";\n                dots[i].classList.remove(\"bg-indigo-500\");\n                dots[i].classList.add(\"bg-gray-400\");\n            }\n\n            // Ensure index is valid before showing\n            if (slideIndex >= 0 && slideIndex < slides.length) {\n                slides[slideIndex].style.display = \"block\";\n                dots[slideIndex].classList.remove(\"bg-gray-400\");\n                dots[slideIndex].classList.add(\"bg-indigo-500\");\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Start the slideshow after the page loads\n        window.onload = showSlides;\n\n    </script>"
}